<title>USA: Fla. HFA to sell $62 mln revs competitively Wed..</title>
<headline>Fla. HFA to sell $62 mln revs competitively Wed..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Florida Housing Finance Authority is scheduled to sell $61.575 million revenue bonds competitively Wednesday at 1030 EDT, market sources said.</p>
